==Russian==

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|head=из-, изо-, ис-}}

# [[out]] [[from]]
#:* {{l|ru|идти́}} — ''to go''
#:* {{l|ru|исходить|изойти́}} — ''to emanate, to originate, to come from''
# when added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of completeness, abundance or exhaustion
#:* {{l|ru|укра́сить}} — ''to decorate''
#:* {{l|ru|изукра́сить}} — ''lavishly decorate''
# when added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of destruction, ruined due to use
#:* {{l|ru|писа́ть}} — ''to write''
#:* {{l|ru|исписа́ть}} — ''write upon, cover with notes, write over''
# when added to nouns, specially when they have the suffix ье, it indicates location of an object
#:* {{l|ru|голова́}} — ''head''
#:* {{l|ru|изголо́вье}} — ''head of the bed''
# when added to adjectives for colours, an adverb is formed indicating nuance
#:* {{l|ru|жёлтый}} — ''yellow''
#:* {{l|ru|исжелта-}} — ''yellowish''
# when added to adjectives, it may form an adverb indicating spatial or temporal properties. Usually on archaic or highly formal style.
#:* {{l|ru|да́льний}} — ''far, distant''
#:* {{l|ru|и́здали}} — ''from afar''
# When added to adverbs, it can form an adverb with a sense of direction for an action
#:* {{l|ru|вну́тренний}} — ''interior, inner''
#:* {{l|ru|изнутри́}} — ''from inside''

